/github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104164#issuecomment-2726982199","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104164","id":2726982199,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iinI3","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T20:18:18Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T20:18:18Z","body":"It's not just the documentation, it's the default value, that value should be preserved as changing it breaks compatibility at least technically\r\n\r\nThis though makes me feel like removing the sorting isn't safe and will cause issues in projects, especially ones that rely on this intentional behavior\r\n\r\nIMO this change breaks compatibility generally (even though the sorted nature isn't explicitly documented)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726982199/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726993925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104164#issuecomment-2726993925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104164","id":2726993925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iiqAF","user":{"login":"dog-on-moon","id":159832633,"node_id":"U_kgDOCYbaOQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159832633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon","html_url":"https://github.com/dog-on-moon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dog-on-moon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T20:49:21Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T20:49:21Z","body":"> It's not just the documentation, it's the default value, that value should be preserved as changing it breaks compatibility at least technically\r\n\r\nfor these specific cases, changing the code here does actually change the default order internally, it's just that the documentation is currently rendering the weirdly sorted dictionary (`print(Image.new().data.keys())` returns `[\"width\", \"height\", \"format\", \"mipmaps\", \"data\"]`, even though the documentation is currently suggesting the order is data/format/height/mipmaps/width)\r\n\r\n> IMO this change breaks compatibility generally (even though the sorted nature isn't explicitly documented)\r\n\r\n100% agree with this, which is unfortunate, since my gut feeling is unhappy about the sort haha. it's a pretty interesting tradeoff","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726993925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726994216","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104164#issuecomment-2726994216","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104164","id":2726994216,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iiqEo","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-15T20:50:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T20:50:20Z","body":"The default is serialized for extensions so the sorting matters there","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2726994216/reactions","total_count"